d anyone planning to upgrade their current bike. In Anand, the Royal Enfield Classic 350 on-road price starts at ₹2.20 lakh for the Redditch - Single Channel ABS and goes up to ₹2.61 lakh for the Classic Chrome - Dual Channel ABS. RTO charges (11.28 K), insurance (~₹15.54 K), and registration costs are added to the ex-showroom price to arrive at the final on-road figure.</p><p> </p><p>Royal Enfield Classic 350 Variant-wise Price List in Anand</p><p> </p><p></p><table border="1"><tbody><tr><td><strong>Variant</strong></td><td><strong>Ex-showroom Price</strong></td><td><strong>Insurance</strong></td><td><strong>RTO</strong></td><td><strong>TCS</strong></td><td><strong>Statutory Fees</strong></td><td><strong>On-Road Price</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Redditch - Single Channel ABS</td><td>₹ 1.93 lakh</td><td>₹ 15.54 K</td><td>₹ 11.28 K</td><td>-</td><td>-</td><td>₹ 2.20 lakh</td></tr><tr><td>Halcyon - Single Channel ABS</td><td>₹ 1.96 lakh</td><td>₹ 15.77 K</td><td>₹ 11.42 K</td><td>-</td><td>-</td><td>₹ 2.23 lakh</td></tr><tr><td>Halcyon - Dual Channel ABS</td><td>₹ 2.02 lakh</td><td>₹ 16.21 K</td><td>₹ 11.70 K</td><td>-</td><td>-</td><td>₹ 2.30 lakh</td></tr><tr><td>Classic Signals - Dual Channel ABS</td><td>₹ 2.16 lakh</td><td>₹ 17.25 K</td><td>₹ 12.36 K</td><td>-</td><td>-</td><td>₹ 2.46 lakh</td></tr><tr><td>Classic Dark - Dual Channel ABS</td><td>₹ 2.25 lakh</td><td>₹ 17.92 K</td><td>₹ 12.78 K</td><td>-</td><td>-</td><td>₹ 2.56 lakh</td></tr><tr><td>Classic Chrome - Dual Channel ABS</td><td>₹ 2.30 lakh</td><td>₹ 18.29 K</td><td>₹ 13.02 K</td><td>-</td><td>-</td><td>₹ 2.61 lakh</td></tr></tbody></table><p></p></div></div></div><div class="flex justify-between items-center"><div class="flex flex-col gap-4 w-full lg:max-w-[400px]"><div class="flex gap-4 justify-between items-center"><button class="p-3 w-[231px] md:w-[283px] flex gap-2 items-center text-base md:text-base font-normal leading-tight bg-partner-secondary-to-white-right rounded-lg"><span class="line-clamp-1 b