n features like Tripper Navigation. However, concerns about its **inadequate suspension**, **limited top speed**, and **vibrations at higher speeds** are noted. While it excels on smooth roads, potential buyers should be cautious about its handling on rough surfaces and overall power limitations.\",\"overallScore\":78.56}\n110:{\"url\":\"https://static-cdn.team-bhp.com/prod/new-bike-cms/Honda/Cb350/2025/01/03/e1675fad-2dc4-4729-bec1-849697796368-Honda_Cb350_Bike-Image.png\"}\n111:{\"id\":32,\"name\":\"Honda\",\"slug\":\"honda\",\"isActive\":true}\n112:{\"url\":\"https://static-cdn.team-bhp.com/prod/new-bike-cms/Honda/Cb350/2025/01/01/f6deade8-32ae-4435-8496-87fd893500c5-Honda_Cb350_Feature-Image.png\"}\n10f:{\"id\":108,\"name\":\"CB350\",\"slug\":\"cb350\",\"launchStatus\":\"Launched\",\"makeModelSlug\":\"honda-cb350\",\"minPriceInLakh\":1.9999,\"maxPriceInLakh\":2.18951,\"bikeImage\":\"$110\",\"make\":\"$111\",\"featureImage\":\"$112\",\"baseVariantId\":228,\"baseVariantName\":\"DLX\",\"baseVariantSlug\":\"honda-cb350-dlx\",\"isElectric\":false,\"overallSummary\":\"The"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1," Honda CB350 is well-regarded for its **sporty styling** and **refined engine**, offering a smooth ride and comfort, making it ideal for new riders. Users appreciate its **feature-rich design** and **impressive fuel efficiency** for both city and highway use. However, some concerns include **rust issues**, **subpar braking performance**, and **higher pricing** compared to competitors, along with a limited service network that may impact maintenance accessibility.\",\"overallScore\":76}\n114:{\"url\":\"https://static-cdn.team-bhp.com/prod/new-bike-cms/Honda/Hness-Cb350/2025/01/03/c691271e-8a92-490d-ae8e-8eafabc8578e-Honda_Hness-Cb350_Bike-Image.png\"}\n115:{\"id\":32,\"name\":\"Honda\",\"slug\":\"honda\",\"isActive\":true}\n116:{\"url\":\"https://static-cdn.team-bhp.com/prod/new-bike-cms/Honda/Hness-Cb350/2025/01/01/d5e21ccc-8823-468d-86e6-f93bd89495e1-Honda_Hness-Cb350_Feature-Image.png\"}\n113:{\"id\":105,\"name\":\"Hness CB350\",\"slug\":\"hness-cb350\",\"launchStatus\":\"Launched\",\"makeModelSlug\":\"honda-hness-cb350\",\"minPriceInLakh\":2.10601,\"maxPriceInLakh\":2.15601,\"bikeImage\":\"$114\",\"make\":\"$115\",\"featureImage\":\"$116\",\"baseVariantId\":221,\"baseVariantName\":\"DLX\",\"baseVariantSlug\":\"honda-hness-cb350-dlx\",\"isElectric\":false,\"overallSummary\":\"The Honda CB350 is widely praised for its **smooth performance**, **excellent handling**, and **impressive fuel efficiency**, with users reporting mileage around 33-38 kmpl. Reviewers highlight its **solid build quality** and **comfortable seating**, along with modern features like Bluetooth and traction control. However, concerns include a **weak headlight throw**, **challenging gear travel in traffic**, and potential **rusting issues** if not maintained properly. Despite these drawbacks, many express satisfaction with the bike's overall performance.\",\"overallScore\":78.7778}\n118:{\"url\":\"https://static-cdn.team-bhp.com/prod/new-bike-cms/Honda/Cb350Rs/2025/01/03/44f6f980-425a-420c-b2ef-471f6f1e7b43-Honda_Cb350Rs_Bike-Image.png\"}\n119:{\"id\":32,\"name\":\"Honda\",\"slug\":\"honda\",\"isActive\":true}\n11a:{\"url\":\"https://static-"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"cdn.team-bhp.com/prod/new-bike-cms/Honda/Cb350Rs/2025/01/01/c67c9c33-6bd4-492c-a13e-83e013bd7167-Honda_Cb350Rs_Feature-Image.png\"}\n117:{\"id\":112,\"name\":\"CB350RS\",\"slug\":\"cb350rs\",\"launchStatus\":\"Launched\",\"makeModelSlug\":\"honda-cb350rs\",\"minPriceInLakh\":2.15601,\"maxPriceInLakh\":2.18601,\"bikeImage\":\"$118\",\"make\":\"$119\",\"featureImage\":\"$11a\",\"baseVariantId\":236,\"baseVariantName\":\"DLX\",\"baseVariantSlug\":\"honda-cb350rs-dlx\",\"isElectric\":false,\"overallSummary\":\"This review highlights positive aesthetics but contains irrelevant content, making it unsuitable for processing.\",\"overallScore\":0}\n11c:{\"url\":\"https://static-c